label_filters.description:
AND-combined label equality filters: `[["key","value"],…]`. Empty = no
filtering (the default). Max 10 pairs; keys must match `[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]`;
values capped at 500 characters.

oneOf.description:
Cost, overprovisioning, and savings analysis. Populated by importers
that can observe the whole source cluster (currently Kubernetes);
`None` for container/platform imports.

Match custom event_data by JSON path
Format: {"path": "user.plan", "value": "premium"}
This will match events where event_data->'user'->>'plan' = 'premium'

